Subject: find-in-chat backfill uses host runtime timeline fetch
Decision: loadAllOlder must fetch via getHostRuntimeStore().fetchAgentTimeline, not a cast of session.client, so Cmd/Ctrl+F search can backfill older history
Verify: npm run test --workspace=@getpaseo/app -- src/hooks/use-load-older-agent-history.test.ts --bail=1
Files: packages/app/src/hooks/use-load-older-agent-history.ts

